    "(if B picked, anti-recommended) ≥ 12 cycle prolonged horizon + minimum-viable scope land + cross-validation vs sibling",
    "(if C picked, fallback) alternate verification path 결정 doc (python3 evaluator OR system wrapper OR 영구 schema-only) (cycle 1)",
    "본 cycle marker 측 23 predecessor markers 측 caveat trail 측 closed (사용자 lock-in + implementation cycle land 후)",
    "후속 implementation cycle marker 측 본 cycle marker 측 cross-link 측 trail chained",
